and instead compute the average of unbiased out-
puts, which we call equitable centroid or weighted
centroid. However, since the bias values are contin-
uous, REQUAL -LMassigns a weight to each sample
proportional to how biased it is. Particularly, focus-
ing on minimizing the harmful bias, the weight of
